        <activityName xml:lang="en">Polymer modified bitumen with 3.5% polybutadiene, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Polymer modified bitumen with 3.5% polybutadiene, at plant
Modern Swiss und European technologies are applied to building machines, material production and building processes. 
UUID: 5bdcbe39-ec59-4faa-a37b-f16d1305039a
This dataset documents the production of polymer-modified bitumen containing 3.5% Polybutadiene in Switzerland, following European standards. It includes processes such as bitumen extraction, transportation, and manufacturing. Waste disposal processes are not included in the scope of this dataset.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: Production of Polymer modified Bitumen with 3.5% Polybutadiene, using industrial machinery.
Time period: Review of data currency scheduled after 5 years.
Production volume: 806436
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_5bdcbe39-ec59-4faa-a37b-f16d1305039a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
